<item>
            <title>[LU-20357] Clear obsoleted exports on the server side</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20357</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In the cloud, the clients come and go; however, the server will keep the exports for those clients forever. This leads to issues that the number of exports get more and more, eventually causing problems to the program that collects those per-export stats.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Lustre should clear exports that becomes old - like if it hasn&apos;t changed for 1 hour.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
